{
    "background_story": "Canaan grew up in a family of tradespeople and always had a knack for working with his hands. After completing his apprenticeship, he became a skilled steamfitter, installing and maintaining the complex systems that powered the city's factories and buildings. Canaan took pride in his work, knowing that his attention to detail and expertise kept the city's infrastructure running smoothly. He worked tirelessly on the docks, in the shipyards, and in the factories, earning the respect of his peers and the gratitude of his clients. Canaan's expertise eventually led to him being hired by the city's largest engineering firm, where he oversaw the installation of a state-of-the-art steam system for the city's new hospital. His dedication to his craft and his community made him a true master of his trade.",
